      "statement": "ArticleFeedbackService.vote/clear each run inside one @Transactional method that snapshots every matched topic's TopicWeight before the write and again after, via the same InterestScoreQueries.topicWeights model used for ranking, so the reported before/after effective weight already includes whatever engagement contribution the vote replaces or restores.",
